{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39069","headline":"南徐晚望 · 褚载","name":"南徐晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草铺香晚岸晴，岸头含醉去来行。\n僧归岳外残钟寺，日下江边调角城。\n入浙孤帆知楚信，过淮疎雨带潮声。\n如今未免风尘役，宁敢怱怱便濯缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}